# Preserve exact Power BI Desktop PBIR/TMDL source bytes on ALL platforms.
# This fixture is evidence-bound: changing CRLF/LF changes its SHA-256 and
# breaks strict native-vs-authoring source-identity verification.
*.json -text
*.tmdl -text
*.pbir -text
*.pbism -text
*.pbip -text
*.platform -text
*.abf binary
*.zip binary
